    "detailed_description": "Fun for everyone! It's time for the crazy kick-off!<br><br>The desk is your field! Lace up your shoes for a simple yet challenging soccer game!<br>4 people for a soccer free-for-all!<br>Make your own original team by adjusting formations and positions!<br>Aim to win the tournament! <br><br>[Practice Match]<br>Pit your team against the CPU for practice,<br>or spectate a match between two CPU teams!<br><br>[Friendly Match]<br>Up to 4 players<br>Take on a soccer titan in a 3 on 1 ambush, or compete evenly, 2 on 2.<br>Choose sides as you like!<br>A world of scenarios awaits you!<br><br>[Team Selection]<br>You can decide everything, from player names to formations, numbers, and positions.<br>Assign power-up items and statuses <br>to create your own original team!<br><br>[Tournament]<br>Particiapte in tournaments with other veteran players.<br>Strengthen your team, polish your techniques,<br>and aim for the win!<br><br>[Free Kick Prize Pool]<br>Use points acquired from matches <br>to score new power-up items, <br>formations, and uniforms.<br><br>[Mini Game]<br>Hit the kick-target for a chance to get extra points!<br>Aim carefully to hit the mark!",
